    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired with the illness; no fever or night sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No yellowing of the eyes; vision normal</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough, sputum, or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Nausea, two vomits yesterday, and loose stools; no right upper abdominal pain, blood, or pale stools</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Urine orange from rifampin as expected, not dark brown</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No jaundice, rash, or itching</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No numbness or tingling of the hands or feet</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Disappointed about the party; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>8 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

